{
    "title": "Borrow Money: Cash Advance App",
    "description": "If you need cash fast and struggle to borrow money from credit cards or traditional lenders like banks, a cash advance loan could be the next best option.\r\n\r\nIt acts as an advance on your wages, letting you cover urgent purchases or unexpected expenses until you next get paid.\r\n\r\nOur cash loan app makes money borrowing even easier, connecting you to loan lenders who can deposit your funds as fast as on the next business day.\r\n\r\nThe cash advance app lets you request between $100 and $2,500 - just submit an amount along with your basic info, and we'll do all the hard work.\r\n\r\nUsing our loan app is better than searching for lenders by yourself because it passes your details around a network of over a hundred lenders in an instant. If connected with one of these, the application can be completed fully online. You never have to fill out a form or scan your documents to borrow money instantly \u2013 sign for a loan in minutes from your couch!\r\n\r\nIt's as close to an instant cash advance as you can get. You only need to meet some basic requirements to use our app:\r\n\r\n \u2705 Be a legal US citizen with a fixed address.\r\n \u2705 Be 18 years of age or older.\r\n \u2705 Earn at least $1,000 per month.\r\n \u2705 Have a bank account in your name.\r\n\r\nJust follow these simple steps to start using our cash advance app:\r\n\r\n \u27a1\ufe0f Choose the amount from $100 to $2,500.\r\n \u27a1\ufe0f Provide your information, such as name, contact info, SSN, and checking account details.\r\n \u27a1\ufe0f Wait just a few short minutes to see if you have been offered a loan by a lender.\r\n \u27a1\ufe0f Review the offer thoroughly and digitally sign it if you want to proceed with this loan.\r\n\r\nThat's it! No physical paperwork or waiting in line. What's more, borrowing money via our app is absolutely free! \r\n\r\nThough we can't guarantee that no credit check will be carried out, users with bad credit still stand a chance of getting approved.\r\n\r\nMaterial Disclosure.\r\n\r\nThis money borrowing app is not the lender, a loan broker, or agent for any such entity. We make no credit, lending, or approval decisions. The app's sole function is to connect users looking for payday loans with licensed lenders that can offer between $100 and $2,500. Not all lenders can provide these amounts. There is no guarantee that you will be accepted by a lender. By using this cash loan app, potential borrowers are not obligated to correspond with a lender, apply for a loan, or accept an eventual loan offer. Completing an application is not a loan solicitation and doesn't represent an offer if that application was made in a state that prohibits the underlying loan product.\r\n\r\n<b>The minimum and maximum period for repayment - from 65 days to 3 years. Precise terms can vary between lenders.</b>\r\n\r\nAPR Disclosure.\r\n\r\nYour money loan's cost is expressed as an Annual Percentage Rate (APR). This is the yearly rate dependent on the principal amount, repayment schedule, and other terms of the loan. The maximum APR you can be charged is limited by some states. <b>APRs range from 6.63% up to 35.99% for qualified consumers and vary by lender</b>. When you borrow money with our app, the APR and other loan conditions are clearly shown to you by your lender prior to signing the agreement, which is a legal requirement. \r\n\r\n<b>Below is a representative example of how APR might be calculated (all applicable fees included):</b>\r\n\r\nA loan of $2,000 taken out over 2 years with a 19% APR will cost you:\r\n\r\n \u2022 Total charge: $2,000 * 0.19 (19% APR) * 2 (2 years) = $760\r\n \u2022 Total amount you would have to repay: $2,000 + $760 = $2,760\r\n \u2022 Monthly loan payment: $2,760 / 24 = $115\r\n\r\n Thank you for using our app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "If you need cash fast and struggle to borrow money from credit cards or traditional lenders like banks, a cash advance loan could be the next best option.<br><br>It acts as an advance on your wages, letting you cover urgent purchases or unexpected expenses until you next get paid.<br><br>Our cash loan app makes money borrowing even easier, connecting you to loan lenders who can deposit your funds as fast as on the next business day.<br><br>The cash advance app lets you request between $100 and $2,500 - just submit an amount along with your basic info, and we&#39;ll do all the hard work.<br><br>Using our loan app is better than searching for lenders by yourself because it passes your details around a network of over a hundred lenders in an instant. If connected with one of these, the application can be completed fully online. You never have to fill out a form or scan your documents to borrow money instantly \u2013 sign for a loan in minutes from your couch!<br><br>It&#39;s as close to an instant cash advance as you can get. You only need to meet some basic requirements to use our app:<br><br> \u2705 Be a legal US citizen with a fixed address.<br> \u2705 Be 18 years of age or older.<br> \u2705 Earn at least $1,000 per month.<br> \u2705 Have a bank account in your name.<br><br>Just follow these simple steps to start using our cash advance app:<br><br> \u27a1\ufe0f Choose the amount from $100 to $2,500.<br> \u27a1\ufe0f Provide your information, such as name, contact info, SSN, and checking account details.<br> \u27a1\ufe0f Wait just a few short minutes to see if you have been offered a loan by a lender.<br> \u27a1\ufe0f Review the offer thoroughly and digitally sign it if you want to proceed with this loan.<br><br>That&#39;s it! No physical paperwork or waiting in line. What&#39;s more, borrowing money via our app is absolutely free! <br><br>Though we can&#39;t guarantee that no credit check will be carried out, users with bad credit still stand a chance of getting approved.<br><br>Material Disclosure.<br><br>This money borrowing app is not the lender, a loan broker, or agent for any such entity. We make no credit, lending, or approval decisions. The app&#39;s sole function is to connect users looking for payday loans with licensed lenders that can offer between $100 and $2,500. Not all lenders can provide these amounts. There is no guarantee that you will be accepted by a lender. By using this cash loan app, potential borrowers are not obligated to correspond with a lender, apply for a loan, or accept an eventual loan offer. Completing an application is not a loan solicitation and doesn&#39;t represent an offer if that application was made in a state that prohibits the underlying loan product.<br><br><b>The minimum and maximum period for repayment - from 65 days to 3 years. Precise terms can vary between lenders.</b><br><br>APR Disclosure.<br><br>Your money loan&#39;s cost is expressed as an Annual Percentage Rate (APR). This is the yearly rate dependent on the principal amount, repayment schedule, and other terms of the loan. The maximum APR you can be charged is limited by some states. <b>APRs range from 6.63% up to 35.99% for qualified consumers and vary by lender</b>. When you borrow money with our app, the APR and other loan conditions are clearly shown to you by your lender prior to signing the agreement, which is a legal requirement. <br><br><b>Below is a representative example of how APR might be calculated (all applicable fees included):</b><br><br>A loan of $2,000 taken out over 2 years with a 19% APR will cost you:<br><br> \u2022 Total charge: $2,000 * 0.19 (19% APR) * 2 (2 years) = $760<br> \u2022 Total amount you would have to repay: $2,000 + $760 = $2,760<br> \u2022 Monthly loan payment: $2,760 / 24 = $115<br><br> Thank you for using our app.",
